  <name>Hyperrogue</name>
  <summary>An SDL roguelike in a non-euclidean world</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
  You are a lone outsider in a strange, non-Euclidean world.
  Fight to find treasures and get the fabulous Orbs of Yendor!
  </p>
    <p>
  Hyperrogue can work in SDL, Escher or ASCII mode. It can also run on 
different modes, like Chaos, Tactical or even Shmup!
  </p>
  </description>
